+- **N11 — Minor reader leniencies.** serialize.odin:300-301: `is_node` bytes other than 0/1 silently decode as pipe-demolish (`r_u8(&r) == 1`); trailing garbage after the last record is ignored. The round-trip proper is verified symmetric (writer/reader field order, LE, versioned header, defined rejections for magic/version/unknown tag, catalog_hash + logic_hz carried). Guard: reject `is_node > 1` and trailing bytes.
