+- **N12 — Parser silent fallbacks.** demo_parse.odin:165-180: unknown tier name → `standard`, unknown class → `none` (typo'd demos do the wrong thing silently); demo_parse.odin:102-115: negative seeds/times wrap through `u64(v)`/`i64(v)`; "capture at" with no times → none. Guard: error on unknown names.
+- **N13 — Name resolution nondeterminism + intent ordering traps.** demo_parse.odin:185-205: `resolve_one`/`resolve_pipe_ref` iterate a `map` on crc8 collision → collision → order-dependent (nondeterministic) binding — all 26 current names verified collision-free, latent. Unresolved names → id 0 → loud validation rejection (good). demo main.odin:186-198: an out-of-order intent file (later frame listed first) blocks the earlier intent until the later one's frame — applies late, silently. Guard: detect crc8 collisions when inserting names; sort/validate intent order at parse.
